## Interface: 11200
## Title: Spoken Quests
## Notes: Quest and gossip dialogue read aloud, through the Spoken player. Formerly VoiceOver Redux. Restores quest and gossip voiceovers on the 1.12 client.
## Notes-deDE: Quest- und Tratschdialoge, vorgelesen durch den Spoken-Player. Ehemals VoiceOver Redux. Stellt die Quest- und Tratsch-Vertonungen auf 1.12-Servern wieder her.
## Notes-esES: Diálogos de misiones y charlas leídos en voz alta a través del reproductor Spoken. Anteriormente VoiceOver Redux. Restaura las voces de misiones y charlas en servidores 1.12.
## Notes-esMX: Diálogos de misiones y charlas leídos en voz alta a través del reproductor Spoken. Anteriormente VoiceOver Redux. Restaura las voces de misiones y charlas en servidores 1.12.
## Notes-frFR: Dialogues de quêtes et de discussions lus à voix haute grâce au lecteur Spoken. Anciennement VoiceOver Redux. Restaure les voix des quêtes et discussions sur les serveurs 1.12.
## Notes-ptBR: Diálogos de missões e conversas lidos em voz alta através do reprodutor Spoken. Anteriormente VoiceOver Redux. Restaura as vozes de missões e conversas em servidores 1.12.
## Notes-ruRU: Диалоги заданий и сплетен, озвученные через проигрыватель Spoken. Ранее — VoiceOver Redux. Возвращает озвучку заданий и сплетен на серверах 1.12.
## Notes-koKR: Spoken 플레이어로 퀘스트와 잡담 대사를 소리내어 읽습니다. 이전 이름은 VoiceOver Redux. 1.12 서버에서 퀘스트와 잡담 음성을 복원합니다.
## Notes-zhCN: 通过 Spoken 播放器朗读任务和闲聊对话。前身为 VoiceOver Redux。 在1.12 服务器上恢复任务和闲聊语音。
## Notes-zhTW: 透過 Spoken 播放器朗讀任務和閒聊對話。前身為 VoiceOver Redux。 在1.12 伺服器上恢復任務和閒聊語音。
## Version: 2.2.2
## SavedVariables: SpokenQuestsDB
## Dependencies: SpokenPlayer
# This client installs by hand from a zip that bundles the player, so the dependency is
# hard here where the Blizzard-client .toc files keep it optional. No tombstone: the zip
# is unpacked over the old folder, so VoiceOverRedux is never a sibling on these clients.
## X-Part-Of: Spoken
## X-VoiceOver-Player: 1

